Component: com.badlogicgames.gdx:gdx-platform:1.14.2:natives-desktop
Origin: https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/com/badlogicgames/gdx/gdx-platform/1.14.2/
Source SHA-256: f4847981d27c6524a30f5665036ec8c11f48c8eda7610bb63f742de95ffe1970
License: Apache-2.0
License URL: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The upstream desktop-native JAR contains Windows, Linux and macOS payloads.
Engine Lite deterministically creates
gdx-platform-1.14.2-natives-windows-linux.jar from the pinned source and keeps
only:

- gdx.dll
- gdx64.dll
- libgdx64.so
- libgdxarm.so
- libgdxarm64.so
- libgdxriscv64.so

The curated artifact excludes libgdx64.dylib and libgdxarm64.dylib. The build
verifies the source digest and exact input/output entry allowlists before the
artifact can enter the distribution.
